<template><section class="reports"><el-alert v-if="error" :title="error" type="error" :closable="false"/><el-tabs v-model="reportTab"><el-tab-pane v-if="canManage" label="问题类型" name="types"><el-alert title="先创建问题类型，再为该类型配置处理流程。类型和流程都由你在后台维护。" type="info" :closable="false"/><div class="toolbar"><span>例如：设备报修、物料申请、运营反馈。</span><el-button type="primary" @click="openType()">新增问题类型</el-button></div><el-table :data="config.types"><el-table-column prop="name" label="问题类型" min-width="180"/><el-table-column label="流程配置" min-width="200"><template #default="{row}">{{typeFlows(row.id).length?'已配置 '+typeFlows(row.id).length+' 个流程':'尚未配置处理流程'}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="操作" width="160"><template #default="{row}"><el-button link type="primary" @click="editForType(row)">配置处理流程</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table><el-empty v-if="!config.types.length" description="还没有问题类型"><el-button type="primary" @click="openType()">创建第一个问题类型</el-button></el-empty></el-tab-pane><el-tab-pane label="申报记录" name="records"><div class="toolbar"><el-input v-model="q" placeholder="搜索类型、门店或问题" clearable/><el-button @click="load">刷新</el-button></div><el-table :data="filtered"><el-table-column prop="type_name" label="问题类型" width="130"/><el-table-column prop="store_name" label="门店" min-width="170"/><el-table-column prop="description" label="问题描述" min-width="260" show-overflow-tooltip/><el-table-column prop="created_name" label="申报人" width="120"/><el-table-column label="状态" width="150"><template #default="{row}">{{statusLabel(row)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="stage_name" label="当前节点"/><el-table-column label="申报时间" min-width="168"><template #default="{row}">{{time(row.submitted_at||row.created_at)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="处理时间" min-width="168"><template #default="{row}"><span :class="{pending:!row.processed_at}">{{row.processed_at?time(row.processed_at):'待处理'}}</span></template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="操作" width="90"><template #default="{row}"><el-button link type="primary" @click="open(row)">查看</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table></el-tab-pane><el-tab-pane v-if="canManage" label="申报流程配置" name="flows"><div class="toolbar"><p>按问题类型和适用门店配置流程。所有节点完成后，仍由申报门店确认解决并归档。</p><div><el-button @click="openType()">新增问题类型</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="edit()">新增申报流程</el-button></div></div><el-table :data="config.templates"><el-table-column prop="name" label="流程名称"/><el-table-column label="问题类型"><template #default="{row}">{{typeName(row.business)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="流程"><template #default="{row}">{{row.nodes.map(n=>n.name).join(' → ')}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="状态"><template #default="{row}">{{row.enabled?'启用':'停用'}} · v{{row.revision}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="操作"><template #default="{row}"><el-button link @click="edit(row)">配置</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table></el-tab-pane></el-tabs>
<el-dialog v-model="typeEditing" title="新增问题类型" width="420px" :close-on-click-modal="false"><el-form label-position="top" @submit.prevent="saveType"><el-form-item label="问题类型名称" required><el-input v-model="typeDraft" maxlength="40" show-word-limit placeholder="例如：设备报修" @keyup.enter="saveType"/></el-form-item><p>创建后可直接选择，不会自动指定审批人。</p><el-alert v-if="typeError" :title="typeError" type="error" :closable="false"/></el-form><template #footer><el-button @click="typeEditing=false">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="typeBusy" :disabled="!typeDraft.trim()" @click="saveType">创建类型</el-button></template></el-dialog><el-dialog v-model="editing" title="门店申报流程" width="760px"><el-form label-position="top"><div class="two"><el-form-item label="问题类型" required><div class="type-selector"><el-select v-model="selectedType" filterable :placeholder="config.types.length?'选择问题类型':'暂无类型，请先新增'" @change="setType"><el-option v-for="t in config.types" :key="t.id" :value="t.id" :label="t.name"/></el-select><el-button @click="openType()">新增问题类型</el-button></div><div v-if="!config.types.length" class="type-help">无需退出流程编辑，点击旁边按钮即可创建问题类型。</div></el-form-item><el-form-item label="流程名称"><el-input v-model="form.name" maxlength="80"/></el-form-item></div><el-form-item label="适用范围"><el-radio-group v-model="form.mode"><el-radio-button value="all">全部门店</el-radio-button><el-radio-button value="stores">指定门店</el-radio-button><el-radio-button value="regions">指定区域</el-radio-button></el-radio-group><StoreRegionSelect v-if="form.mode==='stores'" v-model="form.store_ids" multiple :stores="config.stores" input-width="100%"/><el-select v-if="form.mode==='regions'" v-model="form.region_ids" multiple filterable><el-option v-for="r in config.regions" :key="r.id" :value="r.id" :label="r.name"/></el-select></el-form-item><div v-for="(n,i) in form.nodes" :key="i" class="node"><div class="toolbar"><strong>{{i+1}} · {{i===0?'接收与首办':'后续处理节点'}}</strong><el-button link type="danger" :disabled="form.nodes.length===1" @click="form.nodes.splice(i,1)">移除</el-button></div><el-input v-model="n.name" placeholder="例如：运营接收、维修处理、集团复核"/><div class="two"><el-select v-model="n.kind" @change="n.ids=[]"><el-option label="按负责门店的岗位匹配" value="positions"/><el-option label="指定人员" value="users"/></el-select><el-select v-model="n.mode"><el-option label="任一人完成" value="any"/><el-option label="所有人完成" value="all"/></el-select></div><el-select v-model="n.ids" multiple filterable placeholder="选择岗位或人员"><el-option v-for="p in n.kind==='users'?config.users:config.positions" :key="p.id" :value="p.id" :label="p.name"/></el-select><p>首节点为“任一人完成”时，门店可从匹配名单选择发送对象；不指定则分配给该节点全部匹配人员。</p><div class="node-order"><el-button size="small" :disabled="i===0" @click="move(i,-1)">上移</el-button><el-button size="small" :disabled="i===form.nodes.length-1" @click="move(i,1)">下移</el-button></div></div><el-button :disabled="form.nodes.length>=8" @click="form.nodes.push(node())">添加节点</el-button><el-form-item label="系统默认抄送（门店不可修改）" class="cc"><el-select v-model="form.cc.kind" @change="form.cc.ids=[]"><el-option label="指定人员" value="users"/><el-option label="按负责门店的岗位匹配" value="positions"/></el-select><el-select v-model="form.cc.ids" multiple filterable placeholder="选填"><el-option v-for="p in form.cc.kind==='users'?config.users:config.positions" :key="p.id" :value="p.id" :label="p.name"/></el-select></el-form-item><el-alert title="仅送达流程配置的接收人与抄送人。已读不代表已处理；门店未确认解决前不归档。" :closable="false"/><el-switch v-model="form.enabled" active-text="启用流程"/></el-form><template #footer><el-button @click="editing=false">取消</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" @click="save">保存配置</el-button></template></el-dialog>
<el-drawer :model-value="!!detail" @close="detail=null" title="申报明细与回执" size="680px"><template v-if="detail"><h2>{{detail.type_name}}</h2><p>{{detail.store_name}} · {{detail.created_name}} · {{time(detail.created_at)}}</p><el-tag>{{statusLabel(detail)}}</el-tag><div class="body">{{detail.description}}</div><section v-if="detail.collaboration" class="linked-collaboration"><b>关联协作 · {{detail.collaboration.title}}</b><p>{{detail.collaboration.issue_no}} · {{detail.collaboration.status}}</p><p>{{detail.collaboration.completion_note}}</p><el-button v-if="detail.collaboration.can_open" text type="primary" @click="router.push('/collab/'+detail.collaboration.id)">查看协作进展</el-button><small>协作完成仍需按原流程处理，由门店确认解决。</small></section><div class="image-grid"><el-image v-for="f in detail.files.filter(f=>!f.update_id)" :key="f.path" :src="previews[f.path]" fit="cover" @click="original(f.path)"/></div><div class="report-times"><div><span>{{detail.round_count>1?'本轮申报时间':'申报时间'}}</span><strong>{{time(detail.submitted_at||detail.created_at)}}</strong></div><div><span>处理时间</span><strong :class="{pending:!detail.processed_at}">{{detail.processed_at?time(detail.processed_at):'待处理'}}</strong></div><p>以处理方首次已读为准，已读不代表问题已解决。</p></div><h3>送达与阅读</h3><div v-for="p in detail.people" :key="p.user_id" class="receipt"><span>{{p.name}} · {{p.kind==='cc'?'抄送':p.kind==='sender'?'申报人':'处理人'}}</span><span>{{p.read_at?'已读 '+time(p.read_at):'未读'}}</span></div><h3>处理回执</h3><el-timeline><el-timeline-item v-for="e in detail.updates" :key="e.id" :timestamp="time(e.created_at)">{{e.name}} · {{actions[e.action]}}<div class="body">{{e.content}}</div><div class="image-grid"><el-image v-for="f in detail.files.filter(f=>f.update_id===e.id)" :key="f.path" :src="previews[f.path]" fit="cover" @click="original(f.path)"/></div></el-timeline-item></el-timeline><template v-if="detail.can_comment"><el-input v-model="content" type="textarea" :rows="4" maxlength="5000" placeholder="补充说明或填写处理结果"/><div class="toolbar"><el-button :disabled="busy||!content.trim()" @click="act('comment')">回复</el-button><div v-if="detail.can_review"><el-button :disabled="busy||!content.trim()" @click="act('reject')">退回补充</el-button><el-button type="primary" :disabled="busy||!content.trim()" @click="act('approve')">完成当前节点</el-button></div></div></template><p v-if="detail.status==='resolved'">等待门店申报人确认解决；未解决可继续提交处理。</p></template></el-drawer></section></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,onMounted,watch} from 'vue';import {useRoute,useRouter} from 'vue-router';const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter();import {ElMessage,ElMessageBox} from 'element-plus';import {storeReportApi as api} from '@/api';import {useAuthStore} from '@/stores/auth';import StoreRegionSelect from './StoreRegionSelect.vue';const auth=useAuthStore(),canManage=computed(()=>(auth.user?.position_permissions||[]).some(p=>p==='*'||p==='workflow.manage'));const config=ref({templates:[],types:[],stores:[],regions:[],users:[],positions:[]}),rows=ref([]),detail=ref(null),q=ref(''),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false),editing=ref(false),selectedType=ref(null),form=ref({nodes:[],cc:{kind:'users',ids:[]}}),content=ref(''),previews=ref({});const reportTab=ref('records'),typeEditing=ref(false),typeDraft=ref(''),typeError=ref(''),typeBusy=ref(false);const labels={open:'待处理',processing:'处理中',returned:'待补充',resolved:'待确认解决',archived:'已归档'},actions={submit:'发起申报',comment:'补充消息',approve:'节点完成',reject:'退回补充',archive:'解决归档',reopen:'继续处理',resubmit:'重新提交',collaboration:'发起协作'},node=()=>({name:'处理节点',kind:'positions',ids:[],mode:'any'}),time=v=>new Date(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}),typeName=b=>config.value.types.find(t=>t.id===Number(b.split(':')[1]))?.name||'';const statusLabel=r=>['open','processing'].includes(r.status)?(r.processing_label||labels[r.status]):labels[r.status];const filtered=computed(()=>rows.value.filter(r=>[r.type_name,r.store_name,r.description].join(' ').includes(q.value)));
async function load(){try{rows.value=(await api.list()).rows;if(canManage.value){config.value=await api.config();if(!config.value.types.length&&!rows.value.length)reportTab.value='types'}error.value=''}catch(e){error.value=e.message}}
const typeFlows=id=>config.value.templates.filter(t=>t.business==='store-report:'+id)
function openType(){typeDraft.value='';typeError.value='';typeEditing.value=true}
async function saveType(){if(typeBusy.value||!typeDraft.value.trim())return;typeBusy.value=true;typeError.value='';try{const result=await api.createType({name:typeDraft.value});config.value=await api.config();if(editing.value){selectedType.value=result.type.id;setType(result.type.id)}else reportTab.value='types';typeEditing.value=false;ElMessage.success(result.created?'问题类型已创建，请继续配置流程':'该类型已存在，已选用现有类型')}catch(e){typeError.value=e.message}finally{typeBusy.value=false}}
function editForType(t){edit();selectedType.value=t.id;setType(t.id);form.value.name=t.name+'处理流程';reportTab.value='flows'}
function setType(v){const t=config.value.types.find(t=>t.id===v);form.value.type_id=t?.id;form.value.type_name=t?.name||String(v||'')}
function edit(r){form.value=r?JSON.parse(JSON.stringify({...r,enabled:!!r.enabled,type_id:Number(r.business.split(':')[1]),type_name:typeName(r.business),cc:r.cc||{kind:'users',ids:[]}})):{name:'',type_id:null,type_name:'',mode:'all',store_ids:[],region_ids:[],nodes:[node()],cc:{kind:'users',ids:[]},enabled:true};selectedType.value=form.value.type_id||'';editing.value=true}
function move(i,d){const a=form.value.nodes;[a[i],a[i+d]]=[a[i+d],a[i]]}
async function save(){if(busy.value)return;if(!form.value.type_id||!form.value.type_name)return ElMessage.warning('请先选择或新增问题类型');busy.value=true;try{await api.save(form.value);editing.value=false;await load();ElMessage.success('申报流程已保存')}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e.message)}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function photo(p,variant='thumb'){const parts=[];let total=1,mime='jpeg';for(let i=0;i<total;i++){const r=await api.photo(p,variant,i);parts.push(r.chunk);total=r.total;mime=r.mime}return 'data:image/'+mime+';base64,'+parts.join('')}
async function open(r){try{detail.value=(await api.detail(r.id)).record;content.value='';for(const f of detail.value.files)if(!previews.value[f.path])previews.value[f.path]=await photo(f.path)}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e.message)}}
async function original(p){try{const url=await photo(p,'original');ElMessageBox.alert('<img style="width:100%" src="'+url+'">','现场原图',{dangerouslyUseHTMLString:true,customClass:'report-original'})}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e.message)}}
async function act(action){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;try{detail.value=(await api.action(detail.value.id,{action,revision:detail.value.revision,content:content.value,images:[]})).record;content.value='';await load()}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e.message)}finally{busy.value=false}}onMounted(async()=>{await load();if(Number(route.query.report_id)>0)await open({id:Number(route.query.report_id)})});watch(()=>route.query.report_id,id=>{if(Number(id)>0)open({id:Number(id)})})
</script>
<style scoped>.reports{margin-top:20px}.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0}.toolbar>.el-input{max-width:360px}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:12px 0}.node{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e4e9ef;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0}.node-order{margin-top:12px}.el-select{width:100%}p{font-size:12px;color:#84929f;line-height:1.7}.cc{margin-top:24px}.cc .el-select{margin:6px 0}.el-switch{margin-top:18px}.body{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:16px 0}.receipt{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eef0f4;font-size:13px}.image-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:12px 0}.el-image{width:100%;height:100px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}</style>

<style scoped>.type-selector{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%}.type-selector>.el-select{flex:1;min-width:0}.type-help{font-size:12px;color:#9b6b3d;line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px}</style>

<style scoped>.report-times{padding:14px 16px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;margin:18px 0}.report-times>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:6px 0}.report-times span{color:#8995a0}.report-times strong{font-weight:500}.pending{color:#b4773c}</style>

<style scoped>.linked-collaboration{background:var(--el-color-primary-light-9);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0}.linked-collaboration p{white-space:pre-wrap}.linked-collaboration small{display:block;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);margin-top:8px}</style>
